  "notes": [
    "Joint optimizer batch/LR regimen,not an isolated batch causal effect.10x LR partly offsets about16x fewer steps per data pass;actual partial batches/Adam steps and KL stops must be reported. Common8192-marker collection batches remove collection-size differences between arms. Fresh seed streams shared by arms are not a claim of bitwise matched trajectories after policies diverge. No policy rules,temperature changes,replay,or further training-scale increase.",
    "First run a synthetic shape/memory profile with no environment hands. Require finite forward/backward/step and peak CUDA allocated memory below80percent device capacity at batch16384; do not silently lower treatment batch or auto-retry an OOM as a new regimen. If feasible,train control then treatment,each131072 physical hands at update boundaries with7200s safety guard. Original source and anchors remain frozen.",
    "Freeze each final endpoint by budget,not score. Independent sampled_both_sides evaluation with seed20260899 and4096 mirrored pairs per each of3 anchors for original source,control,treatment:73728 total internal hands. Primary comparison is treatment-minus-matched-smallbatch-control;also compare treatment to original source. Admission requires all3 primary deltas positive and >=one nominal95percent lower positive,valid evidence,and nonnegative treatment-minus-source point estimates on all3 anchors. Any admitted signal requires separate independent replication; do not pool or optionally extend evaluation. Report Bonferroni secondary intervals. No Slumbot games or paper-scale expansion in this pilot.",
    "Synthetic shape profile passed finite forward/backward/Adam step with32768 rollout input rows resident and optimizer batch16384;peak allocated823134720bytes. Scratch model weights discarded,no environment hands,no saved policy checkpoint. This is capacity evidence,not measured training strength or a production throughput guarantee.",
    "14 launcher/evidence/gate tests passed and memory profile PASS. Production/evaluation wrapper enforces one set of immutable sources and inputs,per-iteration physical accounting,final-only selection,and a fixed independent73728-hand matrix. It leaves the record RUNNING for review; no automatic restart or strength promotion.",
    "Full execution snapshot frozen before both arms. Same source/deal seeds/collection/physical budgets; only optimizer batch/LR and output identity differ. No live source edits allowed during this wrapper.",
    "Both preregistered final physical endpoints frozen by budget only; original source hash unchanged. Starting fixed independent sampled evaluation.",
    "Both frozen endpoints evaluated against source and matched optimizer control on independent seed. Complete raw evidence and independent CI recomputation passed. Inspect numerical/Adam health and result before finish; no claim of Slumbot success.",
    "Merged all supplemental commands, tests, analysis and notes from deferred_report_updates.json after original wrapper EXIT0. Its PENDING label is retained as historical intent; this metric confirms the merge is complete.",
    "Added a post-completion-only independent result report with writer guard, raw contrast reconstruction, session/file/source SHA checks, finite model/Adam states, native-head/frozen-trunk checks, physical accounting and Adam-step reconstruction including partial minibatches. Initial8 synthetic tests passed; added a rounded printed-value-loss parser and reran9 tests, all passed, while unchanged production continued. The regimen changes critic steps as well as actor steps; descriptive training loss is not heldout critic quality.",
    "An additional read-only check of the immutable control iteration8 archive matched all10 Adam state counters at438 steps to the persisted metric prefix, including16 partial-batch steps. No weights, counters, sessions or live source were edited by that check.",
    "The three fixed anchors are used both for training and assessment. Fresh assessment deals are not a heldout opponent population. Report this limitation alongside the joint batch/LR and single-training-seed limitations.",
    "During the unchanged fixed evaluation, CPU-only analysis of both final frozen checkpoints verified all76 shared-representation tensors unchanged and exact784/56 Adam steps. Postflop delta L2 was0.05442495/0.08212802,preflop delta L2 was0.03631740/0.05100213(control/large). These are descriptive parameter changes,not strength or causal batch evidence. The script read no evaluation outcomes,created zero hands,and retained source/checkpoint hashes.",
    "Before reading treatment contrasts, documented conditional next directions: if the fixed gate passes, independent exact-endpoint confirmation; if it fails, repair/test stochastic external evidence audits then separately preregister an unchanged Standard10 native-sampled external baseline. Historicalgreedy20k is not a sampled-policy baseline. No external games or captured-source changes occurred during this review."
  ],
